 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "In the garden at the dawn of days the LORD God looked and said",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It is not good for the man to be alone",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He made a helper suitable, and the man awoke and saw",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This one at last is bone of my bones and flesh of my flesh",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So here we stand together in the presence of the LORD",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With the people that we love around us and a promise in our hands",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That is why a man leaves his father and mother",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And holds fast to his wife, and they become one flesh",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Set me as a seal upon your heart",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As a seal upon your arm",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For love is as strong as death",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Many waters cannot quench love",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Nor can rivers wash it away",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Two are better than one",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If one of them falls, the other can lift him up",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And if two lie down together, they keep warm",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Though someone may overpower one alone, two can stand against him",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And a cord of three strands is not easily broken",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Set me as a seal upon your heart",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As a seal upon your arm",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For love is as strong as death",
